dotfiles
========

SETUP
  ~/.dotfiles/bootstrap.sh   Link files, write stubs, sync agents and herdr
  ~/.dotfiles/bootstrap.sh --packages
                             Also run the Brewfile (macOS) and mise install
  Replaced files are kept as <file>.bak.<timestamp>

SCRIPTS
On PATH (zsh/zshenv adds $DOTFILES/bin).

  agents-sync                Write ~/.codex/AGENTS.md, create the ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md import
                             stub, refresh the herdr skill
  herdr-config-sync          Write ~/.config/herdr/config.toml and reload the herdr server
  cheat-pager                Color cheat sheets (the cheat pager). NO_COLOR turns it off
  claude-statusline          Claude Code status line (model, context %)
  sync-forks                 Rebase my forks on upstream

CHEATSHEETS
  cheat <name>               Show a sheet (sheets live in cheat/ in this repo)
  cheat -l                   List sheets
  cheat -e <name>            Edit or create a sheet

WHERE LOCAL CONFIG GOES
  ~/.zshrc.local, ~/.zshrc, ~/.zshenv
                             Machine zsh config (the stubs source the repo)
  ~/.gitconfig               user.email and machine git settings
  ~/.vimrc.local             Machine vim and nvim config
  ~/.config/herdr/config.local.toml
                             Machine herdr config. Then run herdr-config-sync
  ~/.agents-local/*.md       Machine agent rules. Then run agents-sync

ALIASES
  cd-dotfiles                cd to the repo
  zshconfig / zshsource      Edit / reload the zsh config
  gitconfig                  Edit the shared git config
